# BACKLOG #7 (the user's choice 2026-11-06): the focused window gets its
# allocation even when nobody is left to give; as much of its own older memory
# goes to sysmem instead. A WebGPU page focused next to memory that cannot
# move was denied and died. A game is still turned away (its engine falls back
# by itself, and a move inside its allocation stalls its frame, #5).
cap 4000
proc 1614 kwin_wayland old
proc 700 pinned old never chunk=64      # nobody may move it
proc 2617 chrome old chunk=16
act 1614 0 4
act 700 0 10
place 700 3000 0 0

mark the browser, focused, fills what is left and asks for more
hint 2617 f
act 2617 0 20
target 2617 900 0.9
at 6
alloc 2617 192 n=6
at 10
expect denied 2617 == 0          # it got all of them
expect evicted 2617 >= 64        # paid with its own older memory
expect evicted 2617 <= 400       # about what it asked for, not more
expect evicted 700 == 0
